  "name": {
   "zh": "深度与摄影机 · CUT3R",
   "en": "Depth and Camera · CUT3R"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "CUT3R 论文摘要：模型自带一个持续的状态，每读入一帧就用新观测更新它，在线给出这一帧真实尺度的点图。这张卡交付每帧摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机）、深度贴图和点云；点云是每帧一张点图、各在这一帧自己的摄影机里，官方没有合成一份场景点云的输出。",
   "en": "From the CUT3R paper abstract: the model keeps a persistent state and updates it with each new frame, giving an online metric-scale pointmap for that frame. This card delivers per-frame cameras (USD and Nuke camera), depth maps and point clouds; the point cloud is one pointmap per frame, each in that frame's own camera, as upstream has no output that merges a scene point cloud."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-20T18:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_long",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
